      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `9651530dbd598478cef0d8f2a2d68bc62cade94d259d43f18ee8fe8feb575534--criminal-courts-2021-22-cube-1-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2021\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 6e7d7add9a466bbdd942952d0968f942224eac0185bd8f9042126bb0e22d8527 | missing |\n| \"Table 1\" | f64a8e3de4e122449a68509c2dc342483e2a7b3cfc2a14b7a89503180af13a75 | missing |\n| \"Table 2\" | c73921a7957f406460766027b1a1623483a0fc560cef3cebebeea68881db4f99 | missing |\n| \"Table 3\" | ae0eca072e6b933fb62dda038b5bbb030f61cdbec3cf7da107803c4ef651dfe9 | missing |\n| \"Table 4\" | 58cfbd45131bb38d7999739496b2afb92c8873d9134723b4bbf2f397cef68f45 | missing |\n| \"Table 5\" | b9e06d073f9c98bd89fca8b4461b509a08ac17d74a80ab70a580385a3c96ecd4 | missing |\n| \"Table 6\" | 55bcf442bb094dff0c702281572216c830de9d02292db5b8ef162e7967cb683b | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- A normalized copy of this workbook exists (a541909bfe1a7f44d214e9ae870bb33e6c43feb181f73b07ed5f930d0cdd8b8c). Layout should match.\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
